{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q411738","formula":"LiFePO₄","hill":"FeLiO4P","elements":["Li","O","P","Fe"],"composition":{"O":4.0,"P":1.0,"Fe":1.0,"Li":1.0},"names":{"en":"Triphylite","uk":"Трифіліт"},"descriptions":{"en":"Triphylite is a lithium iron(II) phosphate mineral with the chemical formula LiFePO4. It is a member of the triphylite group and forms a complete solid solution series with the lithium manganese(II) phosphate, lithiophilite. Triphylite crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system.","uk":"Трифіліт — це мінерал, фосфат літію і заліза(II) з хімічною формулою LiFePO4. Він належить до групи трифілітів і утворює повний ряд твердих розчинів з фосфатом літію і марганцю(II) — літіофілітом. Трифіліт кристалізується в орторомбічній кристалічній системі."},"fame":13,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"crystal","source":"materialsproject","ref":"mp-18951","atoms":47,"license":"CC BY 4.0, Materials Project"},"structure":{"cell":[[5.616,0.0,0.0],[0.0,8.381,0.0],[0.0,0.0,6.239]],"kind":"crystal","atoms":[{"x":2.808,"y":7.011,"z":4.679,"el":"Li"},{"x":0.0,"y":5.561,"z":1.56,"el":"Li"},{"x":5.616,"y":5.561,"z":1.56,"el":"Li"},{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"Fe"},{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":6.239,"el":"Fe"},{"x":0.0,"y":8.381,"z":0.0,"el":"Fe"},{"x":0.0,"y":8.381,"z":6.239,"el":"Fe"},{"x":5.616,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"Fe"},{"x":5.616,"y":0.0,"z":6.239,"el":"Fe"},{"x":5.616,"y":8.381,"z":0.0,"el":"Fe"},{"x":5.616,"y":8.381,"z":6.239,"el":"Fe"},{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":3.12,"el":"Fe"},{"x":0.0,"y":8.381,"z":3.12,"el":"Fe"},{"x":5.616,"y":0.0,"z":3.12,"el":"Fe"},{"x":5.616,"y":8.381,"z":3.12,"el":"Fe"},{"x":0.0,"y":5.453,"z":4.679,"el":"P"},{"x":5.616,"y":5.453,"z":4.679,"el":"P"},{"x":2.808,"y":7.119,"z":1.56,"el":"P"},{"x":0.0,"y":6.322,"z":5.951,"el":"O"},{"x":5.616,"y":6.322,"z"